WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.250
Part four: what your family owes.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.325
Each student owes shifts, and your family owes parent shifts on top of that.

00:00:08.525 --> 00:00:22.720
Green means covered. A number means how many more to sign up for. Families who come up short may see a fee on their band account. Winter Percussion students are the guides: their all-day guide shift is their whole requirement.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:33.760
Adults who volunteer need a background check on file with the school. Students are exempt. This shows where each adult stands; the coordinators update it.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:45.650
Someone missing from your family? Add them here: a parent, a student, or another adult, like a grandparent. Pick Student for current students, and add a cell phone for texts.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.720
Next, in part five: putting your name in for spots the coordinators fill.
